metallb
MetalLB load balancer with optional layer 2 address pools

Provides: metallb
Requires: none
Requires means: another instance selected for the same cluster must provide each required capability
OLM package: metallb-operator
Default source: redhat-operators
Secret namespaces: metallb-system
Channel and CSV lookup: oc get packagemanifest metallb-operator -n openshift-marketplace -o json

Configuration under spec.packages.metallb:
  FIELD                                             TYPE                        REQUIRED                                DEFAULT
  subscription.channel                              string                      required                                none
  subscription.startingCSV                          string                      required                                none
  subscription.source                               DNS name                    optional                                redhat-operators
  subscription.sourceNamespace                      name                        optional                                openshift-marketplace
  subscription.catalogSource.name                   name                        required in subscription.catalogSource  none
  subscription.catalogSource.image                  image reference             required in subscription.catalogSource  none
  subscription.catalogSource.priority               integer                     required in subscription.catalogSource  none
  subscription.catalogSource.pollInterval           duration                    optional                                none
  subscription.catalogSource.securityContextConfig  string (legacy|restricted)  optional                                restricted
  timeout                                           duration                    optional                                30m
  pools[].name                                      name                        required in pools[]                     none
  pools[].addresses                                 list of string              required in pools[]                     none
  pools[].autoAssign                                boolean                     optional                                true
  pools[].l2.interface                              string                      optional                                none

Binding skeleton (replace each <field>):
apiVersion: bootwright.io/v1alpha1
kind: ClusterAddonBinding
metadata:
  name: metallb
spec:
  clusterRef: <clusterRef>
  packages:
    metallb:
      subscription:
        channel: <channel>
        startingCSV: <startingCSV>
        source: redhat-operators
